WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:05,340
Brat, we are all our own people. What are you talking about?

2
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:12,580
Just take a look

3
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:20,980
No, Your Majesty, it’s up to you to see for yourself. Showing it to outsiders is considered a leak.

4
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:26,020
It’s really more than 200,000 taels. That’s amazing.

5
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:29,020
Prince, don't be too excited. This is not pure milk.

6
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:34,020
And you, old man, if you dare to peek at the secrets of Cao Yun Alliance again, I will beat you out.

7
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:36,280
You rough person

8
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:40,280
Okay, my master, you are an immortal, old man.

9
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:45,310
Okay. Weekly income is a bit low. After deducting operating costs, we only have about 180,000 taels left.

10
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:47,310
This is okay too

11
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:51,310
What can you do? You father and son just took away 90,000 taels.

12
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:55,440
What? From what you say, there is still more money to fight for.

13
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:59,440
That's natural. Now Cao Yun's alliance only covers the capital.

14
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:04,440
When it matures, it will be enough to cover the entire chef's job and even work abroad.

15
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:08,210
This is just Cao Yun's. Let me think of a few more projects.

16
00:01:08,210 --> 00:01:11,210
At that time, when you keep it, you can count the money and draw gold in your hand.
